{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "en", "question": "According to AMD's FY2025 10-K, what is driving the need for high-performance, energy-efficient, scalable, and adaptable compute engines in modern data centers?", "answer": "The growing volume of data that must be stored, accessed, analyzed, and managed.", "spans": [{"source": "sec/amd-10-k-2025-12-27.htm", "span": "the growing amount of data", "chunk_id": "c137adb0-b3a3-557f-b4a2-8f29243a84cf"}], "gen_chunk_id": "c137adb0-b3a3-557f-b4a2-8f29243a84cf", "gen_title": "AMD 10-K FY2025", "gen_page": 6, "ticker": "AMD", "fiscal_year": 2025, "id": "g030"}
{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "number", "lang": "zh", "question": "AMD 2025 财年的 10-K 里提到，公司会作为被告或原告卷入各类法律诉讼，而这些诉讼的具体情况被列示在合并财务报表附注的哪一条？", "answer": "列示在合并财务报表附注的 Note 12 - Commitments and Contingencies（第 12 号附注，承诺与或有事项）中。", "spans": [{"source": "sec/amd-10-k-2025-12-27.htm", "span": "Note 12 - Commitments and Contingencies", "chunk_id": "8caf812a-2763-5cbe-82d8-cc1d33a9abc7"}], "gen_chunk_id": "8caf812a-2763-5cbe-82d8-cc1d33a9abc7", "gen_title": "AMD 10-K FY2025", "gen_page": 37, "ticker": "AMD", "fiscal_year": 2025, "id": "g031"}
