{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "en", "question": "In AMD's FY2026 Q2 10-Q, do the Client and Gaming businesses each qualify as a separate reportable operating segment?", "answer": "No; Client and Gaming do not each qualify as a separate reportable operating segment, though AMD continues to disclose revenue separately for each business.", "spans": [{"source": "sec/amd-10-q-2026-06-27.htm", "span": "do not qualify as a separate", "chunk_id": "94eff297-c077-58df-af01-f41c4a0a209f"}], "gen_chunk_id": "94eff297-c077-58df-af01-f41c4a0a209f", "gen_title": "AMD 10-Q FY2026 Q2", "gen_page": 11, "ticker": "AMD", "fiscal_year": 2026, "id": "g033"}
{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "zh", "question": "根据 AMD 在 2026 财年第二季度 10-Q 中的业务概述，该公司面向数据中心场景主要提供哪些类别的产品？", "answer": "面向数据中心，AMD 提供 AI 加速器、服务器 CPU、GPU、APU、DPU、AI 网卡、FPGA 以及自适应 SoC 等产品。", "spans": [{"source": "sec/amd-10-q-2026-06-27.htm", "span": "AI Network Interface Cards (AI NICs)", "chunk_id": "e96eab5f-3610-54ab-978a-c792ad6d0148"}], "gen_chunk_id": "e96eab5f-3610-54ab-978a-c792ad6d0148", "gen_title": "AMD 10-Q FY2026 Q2", "gen_page": 23, "ticker": "AMD", "fiscal_year": 2026, "id": "g034"}
