{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "en", "question": "What capability do Broadcom's fiber optic components provide for data movement in fiscal 2025?", "answer": "They enable high-speed reception and transmission of data through optical fibers.", "spans": [{"source": "sec/avgo-10-k-2025-11-02.htm", "span": "high-speed reception and transmission", "chunk_id": "30a59620-91d1-5e05-aa24-6a1b88fdc10e"}], "gen_chunk_id": "30a59620-91d1-5e05-aa24-6a1b88fdc10e", "gen_title": "Broadcom 10-K FY2025", "gen_page": 5, "ticker": "AVGO", "fiscal_year": 2025, "id": "g039"}
