{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "zh", "question": "博通 2026 财年第三季度（截至 2026 年 8 月 2 日的财季），半导体解决方案业务的净营收相比上年同期增长，主要是哪些产品的需求在拉动？", "answer": "主要由网络解决方案的强劲需求拉动，尤其是定制 AI 加速器和 AI 网络产品。", "spans": [{"source": "sec/avgo-10-q-2026-08-02.htm", "span": "primarily custom AI accelerators", "chunk_id": "c2a42e83-3ebf-5fa1-bdd3-e2eb97c41df4"}], "gen_chunk_id": "c2a42e83-3ebf-5fa1-bdd3-e2eb97c41df4", "gen_title": "Broadcom 10-Q FY2026 Q3", "gen_page": 30, "ticker": "AVGO", "fiscal_year": 2026, "id": "g043"}
