{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "en", "question": "In Intel's FY2024 Form 10-K, beyond industrials, federal, aerospace, and retail, which additional verticals does the Network and Edge segment name as examples it serves?", "answer": "Healthcare, education, and smart cities.", "spans": [{"source": "sec/intc-10-k-2024-12-28.htm", "span": "healthcare, education, and smart cities", "chunk_id": "cdb6a279-3d4c-5581-b055-f052f0776faa"}], "gen_chunk_id": "cdb6a279-3d4c-5581-b055-f052f0776faa", "gen_title": "Intel 10-K FY2024", "gen_page": 18, "ticker": "INTC", "fiscal_year": 2024, "id": "g045"}
{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "zh", "question": "英特尔 2024 财年年报里，公司认为是什么在推动全球半导体市场发生根本性转变，并促使计算架构从单体芯片走向按工作负载优化的互连小芯片系统？", "answer": "是人工智能（AI）：它对算力的需求不断攀升，同时对能效的要求也越来越高，由此带来晶体管、架构与封装层面的代际变革。", "spans": [{"source": "sec/intc-10-k-2024-12-28.htm", "span": "AI is driving transformational changes", "chunk_id": "82739a06-44df-5d38-9c3f-aa0abf83a2ab"}], "gen_chunk_id": "82739a06-44df-5d38-9c3f-aa0abf83a2ab", "gen_title": "Intel 10-K FY2024", "gen_page": 21, "ticker": "INTC", "fiscal_year": 2024, "id": "g046"}
{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "en", "question": "For Intel in fiscal 2024, what is driving cloud customers' need for higher data center network performance and reliability?", "answer": "Intel says cloud customers need greater data center network performance and reliability because of increased networking investments aimed at supporting AI cluster deployments.", "spans": [{"source": "sec/intc-10-k-2024-12-28.htm", "span": "increased networking investments", "chunk_id": "d4ad4264-3dbd-524c-b218-35f685b92969"}], "gen_chunk_id": "d4ad4264-3dbd-524c-b218-35f685b92969", "gen_title": "Intel 10-K FY2024", "gen_page": 18, "ticker": "INTC", "fiscal_year": 2024, "id": "g047"}
