{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "number", "lang": "en", "question": "How much net loss did Intel record in the second quarter of fiscal 2026 on economically hedged marketable debt investments that it still held at the reporting date?", "answer": "Intel recorded net losses of $95 million on those investments in the second quarter of fiscal 2026.", "spans": [{"source": "sec/intc-10-q-2026-06-27.htm", "span": "net losses of $ 95 million", "chunk_id": "6a489d2e-d19c-5059-9df9-d9d167656561"}], "gen_chunk_id": "6a489d2e-d19c-5059-9df9-d9d167656561", "gen_title": "Intel 10-Q FY2026 Q2", "gen_page": 19, "ticker": "INTC", "fiscal_year": 2026, "id": "g051"}
{"kind": "fact", "fact_kind": "narrative", "lang": "zh", "question": "英特尔在 2026 财年第二季度披露中表示，若其以色列晶圆厂因战争或政治暴力而出现业务中断，为什么可能对公司造成重大不利影响？", "answer": "因为公司没有为战争或政治暴力导致的业务中断投保，而以色列工厂又承担着重要产品的生产。", "spans": [{"source": "sec/intc-10-q-2026-06-27.htm", "span": "not insured for business interruptions", "chunk_id": "0c1e3b79-4f32-5f9d-ac57-b37c03e129cf"}], "gen_chunk_id": "0c1e3b79-4f32-5f9d-ac57-b37c03e129cf", "gen_title": "Intel 10-Q FY2026 Q2", "gen_page": 31, "ticker": "INTC", "fiscal_year": 2026, "id": "g052"}
